inimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><enclosure url="https://github.com/nhwoodward/ryspar-releases/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.1-5/Ryspar-0.1.0-beta.1-5.zip" length="34156015" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="JgMzx693BIHfNt+c2F5WWdMtqzBzdgATnXfq4UX4JTbvZqfLllaG5JpSvav1q9K5tI7x0D8s2COUX5+NVuMYCQ==" /></item><item><title>Ryspar 0.2.0-beta.1 (6)</title><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:57:59 GMT</pubDate><description>Ryspar 0.2.0-beta.1 brings the current dogfooding changes to the customer app.

- Bundled Ryspar host for local terminals, agent processes and backend tasks.
- Native artifact delivery and Point feedback, plus the latest sidebar, usage tracker, browser and settings improvements.
- Customer settings and data remain separate from the ryspar-dev app.
- Existing devices and browser data are retained. Saved workspace metadata is imported from the previous local backend on first launch; saved agents remain stopped until you start them.

Requires macOS 26 or later. Includes Apple silicon and Intel builds.
</description><sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0-beta.1</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><enclosure url="https://github.com/nhwoodward/ryspar-releases/releases/download/v0.2.0-beta.1-6/Ryspar-0.2.0-beta.1-6.zip" length="25960109" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="RgD/cjA9XRJyJyojzG0t52J8GtWnoMmz/gsedGRJgi5xEItLY/NavWwIlnSAU4evKCCz41ZVh+VEsRZ2Hc9nBA==" /></item><item><title>Ryspar 0.2.0-beta.1 (13)</title><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 17:50:04 GMT</pubDate><description>Ryspar is now a subscription, with a 7-day money-back guarantee. Sign in with the account you subscribe with on ryspar.dev. Point also works on pages with strict security policies and rings the button, field or picture you point at.</description><sparkle:version>13</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0-beta.1</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><enclosure url="https://github.com/nhwoodward/ryspar-releases/releases/download/v0.2.0-beta.1-13/Ryspar-0.2.0-beta.1-13.zip" length="59305696" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Q7EGXRFJVMvyrmvURyyfiwXzdpp50Iw621V/faWQ8xsEJCzHnOjs5vIi+7exAhuygcYewG8c2XlJgGcDFKstBA==" /><ryspar:dmg url="https://github.com/nhwoodward/ryspar-releases/releases/download/v0.2.0-beta.1-13/Ryspar-0.2.0-beta.1-13.dmg" length="58744714" sha256="e88b0d54feac869eb61485de98d237a7b08ed46c5159e8eb0755f04705d4e8cf" /></item><item><title>Ryspar 0.2.0-beta.1 (14)</title><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 19:07:59 GMT</pubDate><description>Ryspar is now a subscription, with a 7-day money-back guarantee. Sign in with the account you subscribe with on ryspar.dev. Point also works on pages with strict security policies and rings the button, field or picture you point at.</description><sparkle:version>14</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0-beta.1</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersi